  "brain_first": "“先问它在修饰谁，再判断方向和程度。”",
  "sort_order": 1043,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1834
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "四个选项描述性质、程度、方式或整句态度。",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1835
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1836
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "形容词修饰名词/补语；副词常修饰动词、形容词",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1837
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "或整句。",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1838
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先问它在修饰谁，再判断方向和程度。”",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1839
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 情绪与评价词常跟故事转折一起变化。",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1840
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1841
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 看空位附近词，确定修饰对象。",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1842
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 先分正向/负向/中性。",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1843
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 看故事此时处于困难、转折还是解决。",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1844
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 再比较程度：slightly / deeply / completely 等。",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1845
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 在空旁标词性 V/N/Adj/Adv；故事题用箭头记情绪/动作，如",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1846
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "worried→help→relieved；难空先打 ? 继续。",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1847
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1848
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· be/feel/seem + adjective",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1849
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· verb + adverb",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1850
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· fortunately/unfortunately 可修饰整句",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1851
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 修饰对象、情感方向、程度都合适。",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1852
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 如果两个形容词意思近，查后文人物反应，反应能显示强度。",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1853
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1854
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "After hours of searching, they were ___ to see the missing dog running toward them. 情节由焦虑转",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1855
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "为 relieved/delighted。",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1856
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1857
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只看空前一个词。",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1858
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略情绪变化。",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1859
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1860
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 修饰谁？",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1861
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 方向对？",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1862
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 程度过强吗？",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1863
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： C-P 词性错｜C-X 搭配错｜C-R 复现没发现",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1864
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜C-E 情绪线错｜C-S 故事情节逻辑错。",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1865
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1866
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 形副词：修饰谁、什么方向、多强。",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1867
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1869
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 形容词主要修饰？",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1870
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 副词主要修饰？",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1871
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 故事从worried到safe，空格描述心情可能？",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1872
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. very ___ 后多半词性？",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1873
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 只按中文词义不看修饰对象可以吗？",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1874
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 名词/代词或作表语；2. 动词/形容词/副词/整句；3. relieved；4. 形容词/副词取决于结构，但常需要",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1875
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "形容词作表语。；5. 不可以。",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1876
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— C3 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“C3”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 67,
      "sourceIndex": 1877
    }
  ],
